  Flex Saken v1.1 — KanhaUI Port
  All features from flex_saken_noli_flytech.lua rebuilt in KanhaUI's
  dark + crimson Obsidian-style interface. Each original tab maps to its
  own sidebar tab with matching sections and elements.

  Usage: paste in your executor, key = Fl3xs4ken-by_3than-and_luna
  Toggle: RightShift
--]]

